@startuml
title Roadmap 用例图
left to right direction

actor "求职者" as User
actor "模板维护者" as Maintainer
actor "CV / Job / Behavioral 域" as Domain

rectangle "Roadmap Domain" {
  usecase "UC-RDM-001\n管理 Roadmap Template" as UC1
  usecase "UC-RDM-002\n生成基线 Roadmap" as UC2
  usecase "UC-RDM-003\n管理 Roadmap Task" as UC3
  usecase "UC-RDM-004\n覆盖未满足依赖" as UC4
  usecase "UC-RDM-005\n追加领域事件任务" as UC5
  usecase "UC-RDM-006\n查看可执行性\n并触发 Action 事件" as UC6
  usecase "UC-RDM-007\n应用系统模板更新" as UC7
  usecase "预览 Markdown" as Preview
  usecase "校验依赖 DAG" as ValidateDag
  usecase "预览生成/重算" as GenPreview
}

rectangle "Action Domain" <<external>> {
  usecase "UC-ACT-001\n查看优先 Action" as ACT1
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4
User --> UC6
User --> UC7
User ..> ACT1 : 导航至 Home
Maintainer --> UC1
Domain --> UC5

UC1 .> Preview : <<include>>
UC2 .> ValidateDag : <<include>>
UC2 .> GenPreview : <<include>>
UC3 .> ValidateDag : <<include>>
UC4 .> UC3 : <<extend>>
UC2 .> UC6 : <<include>>
UC3 .> UC6 : <<include>>
UC5 .> UC6 : <<include>>
UC7 .> UC6 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> ACT1 : 发布事件

note right of UC2
  Profile + RoadmapTemplate
  + 相对锚点 + 规则 v1
  预览 → 用户确认 → 生成
end note

note bottom of UC7
  保护用户编辑、完成、
  归档及用户模板内容。
end note

note bottom of UC6
  Roadmap 不拥有 Action；
  仅发布可执行性事件。
end note
@enduml
